lenses.brief:
The world and the weapons in first person, judged from captures_dir: tour ('Look: arena tour', every arena of Mission 1), drops, seams, run_street, run_roofs, run_boss ('Run: held back' over arenas 0-2, 3-5 and 6), rooms (the crowd street and the training room), props (the car, dumpster, AC unit and water tank at 1 m and 5 m), props_weapons (the pipe and bike chain lying and held, the Thug's pipe in his hand) and weapons (the glint at 5 and 10 m, a thrown chain). Check against the picked moods (assets/source/concepts/m6/mood_street_a.jpg, mood_roof_a.jpg) and plan D1, D8-D14 and D28:
- doorways, barriers and drops still read as what they are under the dressing;
- the section light per section, and the seam between sections (does the 2.5 s blend show as a pop or a smear);
- props sit on their blocks (no floating, z-fighting or clipping into walls; the van is 0.15 m above its collider);
- the weapons are findable on the floor at 10 m, and the bike chain reads as a chain lying, in flight and in hand;
- both rooms against the level (DRESS reports they keep Tuning's grey sun and look paler);
- the trim sheet's bands (chunky bricks, no lit windows in the far skyline).
Cite each finding with its sheet and tile, or file and frame.

Code, tests, pipeline and ledgers, over the diff from main (git diff main...HEAD):
- the §2 contracts as landed, against ARCHITECTURE.md's '## Full art and audio (Milestone 6)';
- no numbers in scripts (feel numbers are tunables in tuning_data.gd's groups; attack numbers in move .tres from tools/gen_moves.gd);
- the layer rules: presentation (ChainSim, WeaponGlint, the near arm in FirstPersonCamera, the AuditionRoom, section light in LookPost) only reads state and never writes game state;
- the placeholder inventory is honest (tests/test_m6_no_placeholders.gd: every count can fail, nothing is skipped that draws, the allowed list is by name);
- every ratchet a package loosened is logged with a reason in its roster file and calls file, and none is looser than needed;
- budgets (enemy 15000, boss 30000, module 5000, prop or weapon 3000) and the --check rebuilds (run.py per character and prop, player_run.py, gen_palette.py, gen_trim.gd, ingest.py), with no skips;
- the paid-service ledgers inside policy (Tripo <= 900 for M6, balance floor 700; ElevenLabs <= 30000), and no key printed or written anywhere;
- ASSETS.md has a row with source, service and licence for every new asset, and binaries are in LFS;
- the suite's growth (1766 tests and 321 s at M5's end; 1919 and 364 s now) and test hygiene (test_art_heavies.gd leaves 2 unfreed children; Debug switches set by tests are set back).
